Please follow the following workflow for branch creation and PRs:
Create or use an existing issue
Click "Create a branch" under the "Development section on the right side of the issue
Checkout branch locally
When you create PR/merge PR, it automatically closes the issue

Configure Debug->Customize Run Instances->Check Enable Multiple-> create 4 instances
Click Run
Separate the windows, and press the following:
    Click first window, press "1" to start the server
    Click another window, press "2" to start a client, you should see a scene and player load
    Click another window, press "2", a player should spawn on the opposing side
    Click another window, press "2", a player should spawn alongside the first player. (players are spawned on whichever side has less players"
